      "spam": false,
      "value": "I heard a workaround works. \n1. Use OnInteract of some object to call ExitStation RPC of VRC_Station.\n2. In same OnInteract action, activate an object having VRC_Trigger with OnTimer for making slight delay.\n3. By that OnTimer action, call TeleportPlayer action to teleport the player to expected exit location.\nOnTimer must be activated locally or other players are also teleported. So setup OnInteract with \"Local\" broadcast type.\n\n(Chat with my friend in Japanese about this workaround : https://twitter.com/VoxelKei/status/993817333301850113 )",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
