  "details": "Exit points on VRC_Stations parented to an animated object with VRC_ObjectSync rarely seem to work correctly. The player will often exit in the wrong location, sometimes even very far away from the chair. This can be replicated by sitting on a moving chair, waiting for the chair to move a certain distance and then getting up again -- if you get up immediately from a chair after sitting, it won't happen. \"Immobilize for Vehicle\" doesn't seem to help.",
